# Third-party licenses and notices

This inventory was generated for mongoose @VERSION@ from `Cargo.lock` and the
pinned native-library source. It accompanies the exact release binary.

## libnfs

- Repository: <@LIBNFS_URL@>
- Revision: `@LIBNFS_SHA@`
- Linkage: statically linked into mongoose
- Client library and headers: `LGPL-2.1-or-later`
- Generated protocol sources described by libnfs `COPYING`: `BSD-2-Clause`
- Complete source: `libnfs-@LIBNFS_SHORT_SHA@-source.tar.gz`
- Replacement/relink instructions: `mongoose-@VERSION@-relink-kit.tar.gz`

The complete LGPL 2.1 and libnfs BSD license texts are installed alongside
this file and are also included in `LICENSES.txt`. The source bundle preserves
libnfs's per-file notices and its `COPYING` explanation of the split licensing.

